      "content": "It sounds like you are feeling trapped in a cycle where every suggestion feels like another demand to keep fighting, which is incredibly draining. If the idea of \"coping\" feels like a denial of how much pain you are in, please know that your desire for the pain to stop is valid. If you are feeling that the only way out is to end things, please stop and let someone know right now; I urge you to call or text 988.",
